# Generated chemistry exports: ~25 MB, rebuilt by `uv run python -m chem export`.
# Nothing reads these at runtime — they exist to be inspected and to feed puzzle
# generation offline. The bundles under frontend/public/puzzles are deliberately
# NOT ignored: those are the shipped game content, and the frontend has no
# backend to fetch them from.
backend/data/
